  "teleporter/30256-4.htm": {
   "file": "teleporter/30256-4.htm",
   "quest": null,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Bella: Here in Gludio there is an Airship Dock for Airships heading to Gracia. Gracia is surrounded by a powerful magic force field, so it's impossible to enter it via teleportation or by sea. Only Airships made in Gracia are able to safely travel between the two continents. A dock made …",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Bella",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Teleport to Gludio Airship Field.",
