  "Q00419_GetAPet/30256-02.html": {
   "file": "Q00419_GetAPet/30256-02.html",
   "quest": 419,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Belladonna: Pets help their owners in a number of ways. If your inventory is low or you have exceeded your weight limit, you can use your pets to carry some of your items. Just be careful not to use your pets too often on errands, no matter how useful they may be. There is also something…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Belladonna",
   "links": [
    {
     "text": "Next.",
     "bypass": "Quest Q00419_GetAPet 30256-03.html",
     "kind": "quest-event",
     "script": "Q00419_GetAPet",
     "event": "30256-03.html",
     "quest": 419,
     "to": "Q00419_GetAPet/30256-03.html"
    }
   ]
  },
  "Q00419_GetAPet/30256-03.html": {
   "file": "Q00419_GetAPet/30256-03.html",
   "quest": 419,
   "text": "Gatekeeper Bella: Your pet shall be a wolf. You must learn more about them. Wolves are biologically classified as canines . Canines are extremely varied, and include dogs, raccoons, foxes, jackals, and even timberwolves. The lifespan of wolves in the wild is unknown, but wolves in captivity can liv…",
   "header": "Gatekeeper Bella",
   "outcome": "dead-end",
   "links": []
  },
